   "source": [
    "## Key Takeaways & Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Data Engineering Acceleration**: Vectorized operations in **`NumPy`** outperform pure Python loops and standard data structures by orders of magnitude, providing the foundation for all modern ML libraries.\n",
    "2. **Gradient Boosting Performance**:\n",
    "   - **`XGBoost`** provides the **fastest training runtime (197.19 ms)** with competitive accuracy (94.74%).\n",
    "   - **`LightGBM`** delivers peak classification accuracy (**96.49%**).\n",
    "   - **`Scikit-Learn`** remains the premier unified API for preprocessing, standard baseline models, and metric evaluation.\n",
    "3. **MLOps Best Practices**: Implementing structured experiment tracking (as demonstrated by our lightweight logger or production tools like **MLflow** / **W&B**) ensures complete reproducibility, model auditing, and seamless deployment across team environments."
   ]
  }
 ]
